div.p:
Comparatively few bilateral treaties were revived under these provisions. The
                    action of five states is recorded as follows: for Belgium, see Reichsgesetzblatt, 1920, ii, 1397; France, ibid., i, 946; Great Britain, ibid., ii, 1543;
                    Greece, ibid., p. 1544; Italy, ibid., p. 1577.
